WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
A beautiful day begins again

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I'll say hello, hello, handsome guy

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,760
Handsome guy, I dreamed of being with you

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,600
Can we continue talking now that we're awake?

5
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,780
Hehehehe

6
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,180
So young and so serious that we can’t leave each other even if we talk to each other

7
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,980
Nen is really a cold seal

8
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,580
Click to leave immediately so that Neng can not see An

9
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:20,780
That's it

10
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:23,180
It's great to be selfish

11
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:25,380
You should leave quickly and stop pretending.

12
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,980
You have my feelings in your heart, right?

13
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:38,190
You still love me, Yoyo

14
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:39,590
Do you eat garbage?

15
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:40,990
Because my family has arrived

16
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:43,590
Go around with your grandparents to accompany Jiaojiao

17
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:46,290
I don’t know if this little loser Yoyo will be sad.

18
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:49,050
Didn't you wake up?

19
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:50,850
Are you still dreaming?

20
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:52,550
You can eat garbage early in the morning

21
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:54,500
This is too happy, right?

22
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,600
We Jiaojiao have been kind since childhood

23
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:01,060
Very fond of small animals

24
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:03,030
Accompany the old gentleman and the old lady

25
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:05,730
Jiaojiao is a good child but

26
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:07,230
You're welcome

27
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:10,430
This is what my Jiaojiao should do, right?

28
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:11,930
We got it

29
00:01:11,930 --> 00:01:13,530
No need for gifts

30
00:01:13,530 --> 00:01:15,530
Jiaojiao's cloakroom is full

31
00:01:15,530 --> 00:01:17,430
Can't wear it at all

32
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:20,330
I think Jiaojiao and Wuyou are quite close.

33
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,530
Maybe the two kids can play together

34
00:01:22,530 --> 00:01:25,340
Let them see each other more often in the future

35
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:27,340
old gentleman old lady

36
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:28,540
IMHO

37
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:30,140
The one I saved yesterday was safe and sound.

38
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:31,140
Not Jiaojiao

39
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:34,780
She's your little daughter

40
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:37,780
It’s another little daughter Youyou
